foldkit-dials

This package contains material from the following projects.

DialKit
https://github.com/joshpuckett/dialkit
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Josh Puckett. Full text: LICENSE.dialkit.
- src/styles/dials.css: DialKit's stylesheet, with a foldkit-dials overrides
  section appended.
- src/dialPanel/icons.ts: DialKit's icon paths.
- Algorithms ported to Effect and Foldkit: colour parsing and gamut mapping
  (src/color), Bézier editor geometry (src/bezierEditor), the spring and easing
  curves (src/curve, src/transition), shortcut steps (src/dialPanel/shortcuts.ts),
  version naming (src/dialPanel/versions.ts), and timeline sampling and the
  dock's gestures (src/timeline, src/dialTimeline).

Foldkit UI
https://github.com/foldkit/foldkit
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Devin Jameson. Full text: LICENSE.foldkit.
- src/internal/selectors.ts and src/internal/accessibleName.ts are copied from
  @foldkit/ui's internal helpers.
